    "long_instructions": "### **Write It Yourself**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Build:** Write code so that when the user clicks the **Check My Order** button, if they have over 200 points they get a 10% discount, otherwise they don't get a discount.\r\n\r\n    - Hint: Make sure your message appears in the discount result area.\r\n\r\n2. **Test:** Try different point values and check that the right message appears.\r\n\r\n3. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n   * declares and uses variables\r\n   * checks the `if` / `else` condition\r\n   * changes the message in the text area\r\n"
